# Ordered by how much work they are: level 1 is a single push, level 15 takes
# eighty and asks you to juggle four crates against each other. `demo` is a
# push-optimal solution found by A* over push states. It is what the
# self-playing run replays, and it is the proof that the level beside it can be
# solved at all.
